{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":4,"ref":"zechariah 2:4","book":"zechariah","lang":"id","chapter":2,"translation":"Lalu aku berkata: Apakah ⟨mereka⟩ ini datang untuk lakukan? Dan ⟨ia⟩ menjawab, dengan mengatakan: Inilah tanduk-tanduk yang menyebarkan ⟨את⟩ Yehuda, sehingga tiada seorang pun mengangkat kepalanya; dan ⟨mereka⟩ ini datang untuk membuat gentar, untuk melemparkan jatuh tanduk-tanduk bangsa-bangsa, yang mengangkat tanduk terhadap tanah Yehuda, untuk menyebarkannya.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואמר","gloss":"Lalu aku berkata"},{"surface":"מה","gloss":"Apakah"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"ini"},{"surface":"באים","gloss":"datang"},{"surface":"לעשות","gloss":"untuk lakukan"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"Dan menjawab"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"dengan mengatakan"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"Ini"},{"surface":"הקרנות","gloss":"tanduk-tanduk"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"yang"},{"surface":"זרו","gloss":"menyebarkan"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Yehuda"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"Yehuda"},{"surface":"כפי","gloss":"sehingga"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"seorang"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"tidak"},{"surface":"נשא","gloss":"mengangkat"},{"surface":"ראשו","gloss":"kepalanya"},{"surface":"ויבאו","gloss":"dan datang"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"ini"},{"surface":"להחריד","gloss":"untuk membuat gentar"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"untuk melemparkan jatuh"},{"surface":"לידות","gloss":"untuk melemparkan jatuh"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"tanduk-tanduk"},{"surface":"קרנות","gloss":"tanduk-tanduk"},{"surface":"הגוים","gloss":"bangsa-bangsa"},{"surface":"הנשאים","gloss":"yang mengangkat"},{"surface":"קרן","gloss":"tanduk"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"terhadap"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"tanah"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"Yehuda"},{"surface":"לזרותה","gloss":"untuk menyebarkannya"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T11:34:32.257231727Z","model":"glm-5.2"}